<title>USA: Sonat sees more Cotton Valley output soon.</title>
<headline>Sonat sees more Cotton Valley output soon.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonat Inc said Monday its Sonat Exploration Co subsidiary has made a third 1996 discovery in the Cotton Valley Pinnacle Reef Trend in the Bear Grass area of Freestone County, Texas, and expects to begin natural gas production from the well in about two weeks.</p>
<p>Sonat also said it has a joint venture agreement with Amoco Corp on two Pinnacle Reef prospects south of the Bear Grass area. Sonat Exploration, as operator, will drill two exploratory tests begining in in early January 1997.</p>
</text>
